The instant petition under Articles 226 and 227 of the Constitution of India has been filed on behalf of the petitioner praying for the following reliefs:
"It is therefore most respectfully prayed that this Hon 'ble Court may graciously be pleased:
(a)To set aside the order dated 04.03.2020 alongwith the Auditor memo No. 08 dated 20.01.2020;

(b)To direct the respondent to pay the complete salary alongwith the arrears and increments to the Petitioner in accordance with law;
(c) To direct the respondent to refund the deducted amount vide the impugned order as per Annexure P1 (Colly);
Dr. Amit Kumar vs Bharati College on 13 February, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/40024451/
1 (d) Pass any such other further order or orders as this Honble Court may deem fit and proper in the circumstances of the case;"
FACTUAL MATRIX 2.
